{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/41551-my-weekely-wod-project-program","id":41551,"title":"My Weekely WoD Project Program","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-02T23:38:09-08:00","id":41551,"title":"My Weekely WoD Project Program","content":"Going back to World of Darkness has rekindled some project ideas of my own. So I will be following<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\"> LostLight's example</a> and make it into a schedule. Some of it has a big start while others could use some work. If this whole thing gets oked and people are fine with it.<br /> <br /> <b>Sunday: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/42920-nephilim-the-revelation-weekly-project\">Nephilim: The Revelation </a></b>(used to be Nephilim: The Chosen): A New God will arise from the ashes of the old and it is the celestials' half-breed children that must prepare the world for it.<br /> <b>Tuesday:<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/43978-the-geshtalt-weekly-challenge\"> Geshtalt:</a></b> A bloodline of inhumanly beautiful Vampires created from the Nosferatu and Toreador who wish to return vampirekind to their exalted status from the lessons of the Book of Nod.<br /> <b>Wednesday: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/45212-madison-by-night-weekly-project\">Madison by Night:</a></b> The Shadow Lord's &quot;Grand Experiment&quot;, a Nosferatu Prince who knows your every move, a Hollow One whose loving Technocrant father wants her back and a mysterious young man who can move any of these groups toward an unexpected direc